    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter Mito, a sandbox adventure game where you explore dungeons in order to defeat an ancient evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a procedurally generated world, acquire items and spend skill points to prepare yourself for a historic battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated world: As you walk an infinite world is built around you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full physics simulation: Every item or object is simulated!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destructible terrain: Build or destroy with high precision!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed from the get go with mouse or gamepad controls: Play however you prefer!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter Mito, a sandbox adventure game where you explore dungeons in order to defeat an ancient evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a procedurally generated world, acquire items and spend skill points to prepare yourself for a historic battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated world: As you walk an infinite world is built around you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full physics simulation: Every item or object is simulated!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destructible terrain: Build or destroy with high precision!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed from the get go with mouse or gamepad controls: Play however you prefer!</p></li></ul>",
